    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about being perfect tho. it's the actual pain of it all. the guilt when i wake up after a relapse, the shame... it just feels like a sickness that won't ever leave. i feel like i'm just dragging this thing around, and it's so heavy. i honestly don't know if there's even a version of my life where this doesn't exist. it's just constant.",
